///
/// Each breed represents a classical AI methodology:
/// - **Symbolic** breeds (Prolog, Strips, Gps) — deduction from explicit rules
/// - **Case-based** breeds (Cbr, Dendral) — analogy from similar historical cases
/// - **Probabilistic** breeds (Mycin, Soar) — uncertainty quantification
/// - **Interactive** breeds (Eliza, Hearsay) — dialogue and signal processing
